BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Merck Forest Hike-a-thon
DTSTART:20261003T080000
DTEND:20261003T160000
DTSTAMP:20261003T150955Z
UID:11369a536593675828a68ae5d906e3@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, October 3\, come hike Merck Forest & Farmland Ce
 nter for a joyful community fundraiser and a genuinely great day on the tr
 ails. Four routes\, rolling starts\, live music at the Sap House\, food tr
 ucks\, a kids' nature scavenger hunt\, and an end-of-day celebration. Choo
 se your hike: 🌿 Farm Center & Discovery Trail — 1.5 miles\, easy\, gr
 eat for families 🌿 Viewpoint Loop — 2.4 miles\, moderate 🌿 Mount A
 ntone — 5.2 miles\, moderate 🌿 Lookout Loop — 6.9 miles\, if you wa
 nt leg day all day. :-) Registration is $25 per person\, and then you rais
 e as many pledges as you can in support of the place-based education progr
 ams and the stewardship work that keeps 3\,644 acres of Vermont forest and
  farmland open to all of us. MFFC is a beautiful place open to all - come 
 walk it with your neighbors. Details and registration: merckforest.org/hik
 eathon Merck Forest & Farmland Center\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Vermont Public is independent\, community-supported media\, servi
 ng Vermont with trusted\, relevant and essential information. We share sto
 ries that bring people together\, from every corner of our region.\, © 20
 26 Vermont Public | 365 Troy Ave. Colchester\, VT 05446
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/merck-fore
 st-hike-a-thon-16-07-2026-17-19-09
END:VEVENT
