BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sensory-Friendly Storytime: The Unicorn Who Hated the Shower
DTSTART:20261003T093000
DTEND:20261003T113000
DTSTAMP:20261003T150955Z
UID:1d72494e749f9d981927a112367b9f@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join local children’s author Stephanie Thomas for a magical 
 storytime reading of The Unicorn Who Hated the Shower: A Quest for the Gen
 tle Mist. This whimsical\, sensory-friendly picture book follows a little 
 unicorn who finds shower time overwhelming and sets out on a magical quest
  to discover a gentler way. Through imagination\, kindness\, and gentle br
 avery\, the story explores sensory differences while reminding children th
 at their needs matter and that there can be more than one way to approach 
 something difficult. Families will enjoy a warm and engaging reading celeb
 rating neurodiversity\, self-acceptance\, empathy\, and understanding chil
 dren who experience the world in their own unique way. Perfect for childre
 n\, families\, caregivers\, educators\, and anyone who loves meaningful st
 ories filled with magic and heart. North Danville Brainerd Memorial Librar
 y Artist Group Info Stephanie Thomas Hello@stephaniewrites.org https://Ste
 phanieWrites.org North Danville Brainerd Memorial Library 4215 Bruce Badge
 r Memorial Hwy Danville \, Vermont 05828 https://www.facebook.com/ndbmlVT/
