BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Dream Theatre at Rock n Rolling Hills Farm: Open Studio Experi
 ence
DTSTART:20261003T090000
DTEND:20261003T170000
DTSTAMP:20261003T150955Z
UID:0a9e16a972e81d5657c8a286e5fd43@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:This fall\, artist and creature designer Kris Manning invites 
 the public into The Dream Theatre\, a one-of-a-kind working studio nestled
  within Rock n Rolling Hills Farm\, for Vermont Crafts Council’s Open St
 udio Weekend\, Loop #10. Blurring the line between fine art\, fabrication
 \, and cinematic world-building\, Manning’s work transforms a traditiona
 l Vermont horse barn into an imaginative\, immersive environment filled wi
 th handcrafted creatures\, sculptural inventions\, and richly detailed vis
 ual worlds. Visitors will step inside a space where art feels as though it
  has emerged from a film set. Each piece is meticulously built with the sa
 me level of craftsmanship and storytelling found in high-end creature desi
 gn for the screen. Known for work in the film industry\, including creatur
 e fabrication for major franchises\, Manning brings that same approach to 
 original artwork. The studio showcases a wide range of disciplines from sc
 ulptural creatures and kinetic pieces to paintings\, mixed media works\, a
 nd experimental builds that often incorporate reclaimed and repurposed mat
 erials sourced locally in Vermont. The Open Studio offers a rare opportuni
 ty to experience the creative process up close. Guests can explore the evo
 lving world of Manning’s upcoming projects\, including a large scale imm
 ersive exhibition currently in development\, as well as a growing field gu
 ide of original creatures that expands the mythology of The Dream Theatre.
  At its core\, the work is rooted in curiosity\, wonder\, and the idea tha
 t imagination can be made tangible. Each piece invites viewers not just to
  observe\, but to enter into hidden systems\, unseen worlds\, and stories 
 waiting to be discovered. Rock n Rolling Hills Farm Artist Group Info Kris
  Manning manning@feralcreative.com https://www.krismanning.com Rock n Roll
 ing Hills Farm 707 Bowman Road B860 Barnard \, Vermont 05031 860-305-7975 
 https://www.rocknrollinghills.com/ Submit An Event Find out what's happeni
 ng in your neck of the woods with Vermont Public's free Events newsletter.
  Email Address * Editorial Emails Breaking News | sent occasionally The Fr
 equency | Daily News Update\, sent weekday mornings Capitol Recap | Vermon
