BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vermont Farm & Foliage Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTSTAMP:20261003T150955Z
UID:473711740f4729ffb4c905788ccef9@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to announce the Third Annual Vermont Farm & Fo
 liage Festival\, hosted at Kimberly Farms Stables! See spectacular and idy
 llic views from the Upper Meadow Stage where three bands will be performin
 g. Enjoy local apple cider and treats with various food vendors as you exp
 lore the farm and meet the horses. There will also be activities\, demonst
